<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Hypotekbanken issues new four pct bond. [CORRECTED 14:26 GMT]</title>
<headline>Denmark's Hypotekbanken issues new four pct bond. [CORRECTED 14:26 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by arrangers CIBC Wood Gundy and Nykredit Bank on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BORROWER HYPOTEKBANKEN</p>
<p>AMT 400 MLN DKK</p>
<p>COUPON 4.00</p>
<p>MATURITY 15 DEC. 2000</p>
<p>(Corrects Maturity Date from 4 Dec 2000 to 15 Dec 2000.)</p>
<p>TYPE STRAIGHT</p>
<p>ISS PRICE UNDISC</p>
<p>DATE 6 MARCH 1997</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
